OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new bridge over railway
OL,4,Asubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to replace a
OL,7,Ffootbridge over a railway line.
OL,9,FThe concrete structure on Priory Drive
OL,10,Fin Hull is approaching the end of its
OL,11,Fservice life and is beyond practical
OL,12,Frepair, the city council said.
OL,14,FThe replacement would feature ramps,
OL,15,Fenabling it to be used by cyclists.
OL,17,FOfficials said the crossing would be
OL,18,Fclosed while the current bridge is
OL,19,Fremoved and the new one constructed,
OL,20,Fwith a shuttle bus service to allow
OL,21,Fstudents who use the bridge it to get
OL,22,Fto school, Hull City Council said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
